  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><div><span></span></div><div><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;.SF UI Text&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 17.9px;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: &quot;.SFUIText&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こんにちは</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小坂菜緒です</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-01-27/27285_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_9724.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">最近よく地方の観光地をインターネットで調べてるんです((*&nbsp;॑꒳&nbsp;॑*&nbsp;&nbsp;))</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">中学生になってから、部活があって全く旅行に行ってないので久しぶりに遠出したいなぁなんて思ってます😶💕</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この寒い季節は温泉旅行とか行きたいですよね~</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私が個人的にすごく好きな所は\"小豆島\"です！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小豆島って皆がよく\"あずきしま\"って読んじゃう島名ですよね！（笑）</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ここは瀬戸内海にある島で、とってもとっても海が綺麗なんです！！！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\">(温泉旅行の話は一旦終わりで…。。。)</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この島は、香川県になるので、うどんとかも有名で美味しいんですよ~✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私が行ったのは小学２年生とかだったかな？？？</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">約9年前の話だけど、鮮明に覚えてます！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">観光地では「エンジェルロード」って所があって、干潮の時は海に道があって満潮の時は1面海になるんですよ🐰</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">もうすっごく素敵で、感動しちゃいました。。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">夏に行くと一番いいかもしれない！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">海が透明で綺麗なので海水浴とかするのいいですよ！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私が行った時も夏だったなぁ</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また行きたい！！！必ず行きます😶💕</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">と、私の旅行の話をしちゃいましたが…</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">たまには私の趣味についてお話するのもいいかなぁなんて思ったりも…。。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">って事で、あと一つだけ！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">お話させてください(&nbsp;¨̮&nbsp;)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ほんとに雑談的な感じなので、ゆるーく見てください☺️💫</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私は頻繁に本屋さんに行くんですけど…</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">前までは小説を求めて本屋さんに行ってたんですね</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">でも、最近は\"漫画\"を求めて本屋さんに行くようになりました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">イメージに無かったかもしれないんですけど、意外と漫画っ子なんですよ！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">よく友達に面白い漫画とか借りてました(˙꒳​˙&nbsp;&nbsp;)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今ではずーっと少女漫画を読んでいます😶</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">もちろん少年漫画も読みますよ♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">メッセージではお話してたんですけど、私が漫画を読む時って「主人公になる」事を大切にして読んでいます</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">と言うか、主人公の気持ちになってしまうんですよね、、</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">だから、漫画を読んでる時の私って意外と感情豊かになってるんじゃないかな？？？？</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">読み始めるとほんとに時間なんてすっぽかしてしまうので、それはダメだなぁって思うけど、やっぱり読みたいんだよね~。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">皆さんのオススメの漫画とかあったら教えてください！！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">❀*&nbsp;❀。.&nbsp;✿&nbsp;*&nbsp;❀&nbsp;｡*&nbsp;❀&nbsp;❀&nbsp;* .❀&nbsp;｡&nbsp;✿&nbsp;*&nbsp;❀&nbsp;❀&nbsp;｡&nbsp;✿&nbsp;*&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-01-27/27285_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2884.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-01-27/27285_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1371.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-01-27/27285_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2886.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この写真たちすごくお気に入りなんです</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">BUBKAさんで撮影して頂いた時😶💕</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0